            "paragraph": "The importance of thermal fronts we found here is not surprising given that the most important front feature in our study area is the Shelf-Slope Front (Belkin and Cornillon, 2007), running along the upper continental slope of the Porcupine Bank, which likely contributes significantly to the favourability of this area.",
